<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>American Auto Fix | Auto Repair</title>
  <meta name="description" content="American Auto Fix — professional auto repair, diagnostics and maintenance.">
  <style>
    *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
    body{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.6;color:#171717;background:#f5f5f5}
    header{background:#111;color:white;padding:18px 7%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:10}
    .brand{font-weight:800;font-size:20px}.brand span{color:#e21b23}
    nav a{color:white;text-decoration:none;margin-left:20px;font-size:14px}
    .hero{padding:90px 7%;background:#181818;color:white;text-align:center}
    .hero h1{font-size:clamp(38px,7vw,64px);margin-bottom:12px}.hero h1 span{color:#e21b23}
    .hero p{max-width:650px;margin:0 auto 28px;color:#ddd;font-size:18px}
    .btn{display:inline-block;background:#e21b23;color:white;padding:13px 24px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;margin:5px}
    .btn.alt{background:white;color:#111}
    section{padding:60px 7%;max-width:1100px;margin:auto}
    .title{text-align:center;margin-bottom:35px}.title h2{font-size:32px}.title p{color:#666}
    .cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:18px}
    .card{background:white;padding:25px;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 3px 15px #00000012}
    .card h3{margin:10px 0}.icon{font-size:34px}
    .about{background:white;max-width:none}.about-inner{max-width:1100px;margin:auto}
    .contact{background:#111;color:white;max-width:none}.contact-inner{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;text-align:center}
    .contact p{color:#ccc;margin:8px 0}
    footer{background:#080808;color:#aaa;text-align:center;padding:22px;font-size:13px}
    @media(max-width:600px){nav{display:none}.hero{padding:65px 6%}section{padding:45px 6%}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="brand">AMERICAN <span>AUTO FIX</span></div>
  <nav><a href="#services">Services</a><a href="#about">About</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a></nav>
</header>

<main>
  <div class="hero">
    <h1>Keep Your Ride <span>Running Right.</span></h1>
    <p>Professional auto repair, diagnostics and maintenance you can count on.</p>
    <a class="btn" href="#contact">Request Service</a>
    <a class="btn alt" href="#services">Our Services</a>
  </div>

  <section id="services">
    <div class="title"><h2>Our Services</h2><p>Quality work for cars, trucks and everyday drivers.</p></div>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card"><div class="icon">🔧</div><h3>Auto Repairs</h3><p>Brake, engine, suspension and general mechanical repairs.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="icon">🚗</div><h3>Diagnostics</h3><p>Find the cause of warning lights and vehicle problems.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="icon">🛠️</div><h3>Maintenance</h3><p>Oil service, inspections and routine vehicle maintenance.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="icon">⚙️</div><h3>Mobile Service</h3><p>Ask about convenient on-site mechanic service in your area.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="about" class="about">
    <div class="about-inner">
      <div class="title"><h2>About American Auto Fix</h2></div>
      <p style="max-width:760px;margin:auto;text-align:center;color:#555">
        We focus on honest service, careful diagnostics and dependable repairs.
        Our goal is simple: help keep your vehicle safe, reliable and ready for the road.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" class="contact">
    <div class="contact-inner">
      <div class="title"><h2>Need Your Vehicle Fixed?</h2><p>Contact us to ask about service or request an appointment.</p></div>
      <p>📞 Phone: <strong>YOUR PHONE NUMBER</strong></p>
      <p>📧 Email: <strong>YOUR EMAIL</strong></p>
      <p>📍 Service Area: <strong>YOUR CITY, USA</strong></p>
      <br>
      <a class="btn" href="tel:YOURPHONE">Call Now</a>
      <a class="btn alt" href="mailto:YOUREMAIL">Email Us</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>© 2026 American Auto Fix. All rights reserved.</footer>
</body>
</html>
